The compliance team built a document intake portal so secure it comes with a reviewer bot, a shiny upload form, and exactly the amount of confidence you expect from enterprise software.

Upload your paperwork, submit it for review, and prove the audit was worth the invoice.

Category: Web
Difficulty: Medium

Local deployment:

    docker compose up -d --build

The challenge reads the dynamic flag from GZCTF_FLAG. A local fallback is provided in docker-compose.yml for testing.
